<p>Your business and your clients trust us with their details. Here's how we look after them.</p>

<h2>Your data</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Every business's data is kept separate, and checked on every request so one business can never see another's.</li>
  <li>Data is encrypted in transit (HTTPS everywhere) and backed up daily.</li>
  <li>Passwords are stored hashed, never readable. Accounts lock after repeated wrong passwords, and you can see and sign out every browser you're signed in on.</li>
  <li>Photos you upload have their location data removed.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Your team</h2>
<p>Each person sees and does only what their role allows, and you can remove someone's access at any time.</p>

<h2>Our team</h2>
<p>Shadetree staff who can reach customer data use two-factor sign-in, and everything they do is recorded in an audit log that can't be edited or deleted.</p>

<h2>The application</h2>
<ul>
  <li>A strict content security policy and other protections against common web attacks.</li>
  <li>Limits on sign-in attempts and public forms, with spam checks that don't track anyone.</li>
  <li>Links we send your clients are long, random and can be turned off at any time.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Your rights</h2>
<p>You can download all your data at any time, erase a client's details on request, and delete your account.</p>

<h2>Reporting a problem</h2>
<p>If you find a security issue, please email <a href="mailto:security@getshadetree.com">security@getshadetree.com</a> (see our <%= link_to "security.txt", "/.well-known/security.txt" %>). We'll reply within three business days.</p>
